### Ymmo API — manual test suite
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request"
### above each block. Run the seed (db/seed.sql) first so data exists.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### --- 0. Health -------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### =====================================================================
### AUTH
### =====================================================================

### 1. Register a new buyer (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.buyer@ymmo.fr",
  "password": "motdepasse123",
  "first_name": "Camille",
  "last_name": "Durand"
}

### 2. Register again with same email (expect 409 Conflict)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.buyer@ymmo.fr",
  "password": "motdepasse123",
  "first_name": "Camille",
  "last_name": "Durand"
}

### 3. Register with invalid input (expect 400 — bad email + short password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "123",
  "first_name": "X",
  "last_name": "Y"
}

### 4. Login as AGENT (captures the token for the next requests)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "agent@ymmo.fr",
  "password": "agent1234"
}

### 5. Login with wrong password (expect 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "agent@ymmo.fr",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 6. Me — with the agent token (expect 200 + agent profile)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 7. Me — without a token (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me

### =====================================================================
### PROPERTIES — public
### =====================================================================

### 8. List all available properties (expect 4 seeded, DRAFT hidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties

### 9. Filter by city
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties?city=Paris

### 10. Filter by price + sort ascending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties?max_price=500000&sort=price_asc

### 11. Filter by sector (RESIDENTIAL only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties?sector=RESIDENTIAL

### 12. Filter by energy rating D or better
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties?max_energy=D

### 13. Pagination (2 per page, page 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties?page_size=2&page=1

### 14. Get one property by id (expect 200 + view_count increment)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties/1

### 15. Get a non-existing property (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties/9999

### =====================================================================
### PROPERTIES — protected (staff only)
### =====================================================================

### 16. Create a property WITHOUT token (expect 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test sans token",
  "category_id": 2,
  "price": 300000,
  "area": 60,
  "city": "Nice",
  "postal_code": "06000",
  "agency_id": 1
}

### 17. Create a property AS AGENT (expect 201, status DRAFT, auto reference)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "title": "Appartement T2 rénové",
  "description": "Refait à neuf, proche commerces",
  "category_id": 2,
  "price": 295000,
  "area": 48,
  "rooms": 2,
  "bedrooms": 1,
  "energy_rating": "C",
  "city": "Nice",
  "postal_code": "06000",
  "agency_id": 1
}

### 18. Create with invalid input (expect 400 — missing title, price <= 0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "category_id": 2,
  "price": 0,
  "area": 48,
  "city": "Nice",
  "postal_code": "06000",
  "agency_id": 1
}

### 19. Update a property (expect 200 — partial update)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "price": 630000,
  "status": "AVAILABLE"
}

### 20. Delete a property (expect 204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties/3
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### =====================================================================
### RBAC — a BUYER must NOT manage properties
### =====================================================================

### 21. Login as BUYER
# @name loginBuyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "buyer@ymmo.fr",
  "password": "buyer1234"
}

### 22. Buyer tries to create a property (expect 403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}

{
  "title": "Tentative interdite",
  "category_id": 2,
  "price": 200000,
  "area": 40,
  "city": "Lille",
  "postal_code": "59000",
  "agency_id": 1
}

### =====================================================================
### FAVORITES — any authenticated user (here: the buyer)
### =====================================================================

### 23. Add a favorite WITHOUT token (expect 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties/1/favorites

### 24. Add a favorite as buyer (expect 204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties/1/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}

### 25. Add the SAME favorite again (idempotent, expect 204 — no duplicate error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties/1/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}

### 26. Favorite a non-existing property (expect 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties/9999/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}

### 27. List my favorites (expect 200, contains property 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}

### 28. Remove the favorite (expect 204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/properties/1/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}

### 29. List again (expect 200, now empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBuyer.response.body.token}}
